\newlabel{fig:architecture_2phase}{{2}{6}{Formal overview of the proposed mango disease detection pipeline highlighting the two-phase workflow: (i) lesion knowledge learning from MangoLeafBD and (ii) fruit disease detection using RGB analysis, physics-informed thermal simulation, attention-based fusion, and a classification head}{figure.caption.2}{}}
